    "body": "This is already fixed on `main`: #41208 (16d1c93b3d, merged 2026-09-24) changed the `DECODE` branch of `get_token_ids_logprobs_raw` to append `logprobs.new_empty((0,))` for `None` entries, with the comment \"The CPU copy expects a tensor in every entry under `no_copy_to_cpu`\". The fix is in v0.5.21 and later; v0.5.19 predates it. Running your snippet against current `main` gives `[[...], []]` instead of the `AttributeError`.\n",
